B.agp=new A.aw(B.dr,["How does the AI estimation work?","Simply upload 3\u20134 photos of the damaged area from different angles. Our Vision AI analyses the depth and span of the damage and provides an estimated repair cost and time within seconds."],t.w)
B.agq=new A.aw(B.dr,["Can I choose which partner workshop handles my repair?","Yes. After receiving the AI estimate, you will see a list of certified partner workshops in your area. You can select one based on ratings, distance, and availability."],t.w)
B.agk=new A.aw(B.dr,["Is the repair quality guaranteed?","All re-V certified partners adhere to our SLA standards, and all repairs come with a 24-month warranty on workmanship and paint matching verified by our digital telemetry certificate."],t.w)
B.agm=new A.aw(B.dr,["How do I track my repair progress?",'Open the "Digital Garage" section of your profile. The Live Tracker shows real-time stage updates \u2014 from intake, through active bodywork and painting, to handover. Each stage is photo-documented.'],t.w)
B.agn=new A.aw(B.dr,["What is the Revive 24-Month Paint Guarantee?","Every job completed through re-V includes a digitally signed 24-month guarantee certificate covering paint adhesion, colour accuracy, and surface finish. It is stored in your Garage Profile."],t.w)
B.agu=new A.aw(B.dr,["How are insurance claims handled?","Link your Garda Oto or Astra insurance policy in Profile \u2192 Saved Insurance Policies. Our platform auto-generates the required loss-adjustment documentation and submits directly to your insurer."],t.w)
